WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:09.200
Hi, I'm Frank Lee,

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.400
an AI Engineer and Senior Fullstack Developer
based in Hamburg.

3
00:00:14.917 --> 00:00:19.887
My background is software development,
where I have worked for more than ten years,

4
00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:22.617
mainly with Angular, TypeScript and Node.js.

5
00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:28.467
More recently, I've expanded into machine learning
and building AI applications.

6
00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:33.133
What I enjoy most is turning an idea
into something useful

7
00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.383
and taking care of it once it's running.

8
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.920
One example is Arbeitseule,

9
00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:42.820
an AI-assisted job search application
that I build and run myself.

10
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.000
It helps users find relevant jobs,

11
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.600
see how well they match
and draft cover letters.

12
00:00:48.717 --> 00:00:50.267
Nothing is sent automatically.

13
00:00:50.447 --> 00:00:52.267
The user stays in control.

14
00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:56.933
I am also developing App-Leitstand
to coordinate AI coding agents

15
00:00:56.953 --> 00:00:59.393
and heyAppa, a Korean learning app.

16
00:00:59.413 --> 00:01:02.533
That one is personal:
I am learning Korean myself.

17
00:01:02.883 --> 00:01:06.833
Well, half of my family is Korean,
I would say, nowadays.

18
00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:10.883
These projects bring together
the things I care about:

19
00:01:11.133 --> 00:01:17.183
useful features, understandable code, testing
and keeping costs under control.

20
00:01:17.717 --> 00:01:22.287
I use AI tools every day, and I make a point
of questioning their output

21
00:01:22.917 --> 00:01:25.017
and understanding the decision behind it.

22
00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:27.680
I studied media computer science

23
00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:31.650
and completed further training
in data science and machine learning.

24
00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:35.500
I am now adding Java and Spring Boot
to my backend skills.

25
00:01:35.953 --> 00:01:40.283
For my next role, I would like
to bring this experience

26
00:01:40.283 --> 00:01:43.653
to a team building useful, reliable AI products.

27
00:01:44.033 --> 00:01:47.033
If that sounds like your team,
I would be happy to talk.

28
00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:51.350
You can find more about me and my projects
at frankdavidlee.com.

29
00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:54.200
Have a nice day, thank you for listening.

30
00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.550
See you, bye.
